      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Two hikers paused on the muddy path, anchored right-of-center, occupying roughly 50% of the frame height. Left hiker kneeling on one knee facing three-quarter view toward the right, head bowed down toward their boot, gaze directed at the laces. Right hiker standing upright in three-quarter front view, looking down toward the kneeling hiker's boot. Both wear layered merino base layers, softshell jackets in muted earth tones (one sage, one warm taupe), and worn cargo trousers cuffed above the ankle. Medium skin tones, short dark hair on the standing figure, shoulder-length light brown hair tied back on the kneeling figure. Natural skin texture, eyes catching the cool diffused daylight."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Tall waterproof brown leather hiking boot on the kneeling hiker's foot, fitted over a grey wool sock visible above the cuff. The boot sits on the muddy path, laces partially undone, the kneeling hiker's hands working at the laces."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Low-cut olive-green trail shoes on the standing hiker's feet, mesh uppers with visible weave texture, chunky black lugged soles, grey laces. Standing on the wet stone path."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Pair of steel C1 crampons resting on a flat grey rock beside the kneeling hiker's boot, twelve curved spikes per crampon catching faint highlights from the overcast sky, steel frames with leather straps coiled loosely."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus tuft of bright green bracken slicing diagonally into the lower-left foreground, fronds softly blurred, adding depth to the composition."
      }
    ]
  }
}
